    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To detect text inside an image, I can use the Amazon Textract service, which is a machine learning service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. I will create a Python script that uses the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract. The script will be named 'detect_image_text.py' and will be written in the current working directory. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860070020,
          "start": 1789860067501
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf938ad001mKlkGQL11dI3zD",
