    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the describe_image.py file, I need to integrate with an external provider that can generate a visual description for an image. I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a concrete external provider for image analysis. I will import the necessary Boto3 library for AWS and use the Rekognition client to call the service. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Rekognition client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860064379,
          "start": 1789860061842
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf92292001pZ80SuJ5PToLKr",
      "message_id": "msg_0bbf903af001JzUcgSzXm3emZv",
      "session_id": "ses_f4406fc67ffe0LG2r3Q39ZEn9B",
